+# Supabase Setup and RLS for mutabaah-tahfidz
+
+## 1. Environment variables
+
+Copy `.env.example` to `.env` and set these values:
+
+```env
+VITE_SUPABASE_URL=https://<your-project-ref>.supabase.co
+VITE_SUPABASE_ANON_KEY=<your-public-anon-key>
+```
+
+Do not commit `.env` to Git.
+
+## 2. Supabase table migration
+
+Run this SQL in Supabase SQL Editor for the `riwayat`, `riwayat_ukl`, and `riwayat_absensi_guru` tables:
+
+```sql
+-- Add audit fields for production-ready persistence
+alter table if exists public.riwayat
+  add column if not exists created_by text,
+  add column if not exists updated_by text,
+  add column if not exists created_at timestamp with time zone default now(),
+  add column if not exists updated_at timestamp with time zone default now();
+
+alter table if exists public.riwayat_ukl
+  add column if not exists created_by text,
+  add column if not exists updated_by text,
+  add column if not exists created_at timestamp with time zone default now(),
+  add column if not exists updated_at timestamp with time zone default now();
+
+alter table if exists public.riwayat_absensi_guru
+  add column if not exists created_by text,
+  add column if not exists updated_by text,
+  add column if not exists created_at timestamp with time zone default now(),
+  add column if not exists updated_at timestamp with time zone default now();
+```
+
+If the tables do not exist, create them first with the same columns as the app uses.
+
+## 3. Enable Supabase Auth
+
+1. In Supabase dashboard, open `Authentication` > `Settings`.
+2. Under `Email`, enable `Email Auth` and `Magic Link` if you want passwordless login.
+3. Save changes.
+
+## 4. RLS policies
+
+To enable RLS safely, use these commands for each table. Replace `public` with your schema if different.
+
+```sql
+-- Enable row level security
+alter table public.riwayat enable row level security;
+alter table public.riwayat_ukl enable row level security;
+alter table public.riwayat_absensi_guru enable row level security;
+
+-- Allow authenticated users to read their own data
+create policy "riwayat authenticated read" on public.riwayat
+  for select using (auth.role() = 'authenticated');
+create policy "riwayat authenticated insert" on public.riwayat
+  for insert with check (auth.role() = 'authenticated');
+create policy "riwayat authenticated update" on public.riwayat
+  for update using (created_by = auth.uid()) with check (created_by = auth.uid());
+create policy "riwayat authenticated delete" on public.riwayat
+  for delete using (created_by = auth.uid());
+
+create policy "riwayat_ukl authenticated read" on public.riwayat_ukl
+  for select using (auth.role() = 'authenticated');
+create policy "riwayat_ukl authenticated insert" on public.riwayat_ukl
+  for insert with check (auth.role() = 'authenticated');
+create policy "riwayat_ukl authenticated update" on public.riwayat_ukl
+  for update using (created_by = auth.uid()) with check (created_by = auth.uid());
+create policy "riwayat_ukl authenticated delete" on public.riwayat_ukl
+  for delete using (created_by = auth.uid());
+
+create policy "riwayat_absensi_guru authenticated read" on public.riwayat_absensi_guru
+  for select using (auth.role() = 'authenticated');
+create policy "riwayat_absensi_guru authenticated insert" on public.riwayat_absensi_guru
+  for insert with check (auth.role() = 'authenticated');
+create policy "riwayat_absensi_guru authenticated update" on public.riwayat_absensi_guru
+  for update using (created_by = auth.uid()) with check (created_by = auth.uid());
+create policy "riwayat_absensi_guru authenticated delete" on public.riwayat_absensi_guru
+  for delete using (created_by = auth.uid());
+```
+
+> Note: The app currently uses local role simulation, not full Supabase auth. If you move to full Supabase Auth, update `currentUser.userId` from `supabase.auth.getSession()`.
+
+## 5. Deploy to Vercel
+
+1. Create a Vercel project and connect the GitHub repo.
+2. Add environment variables in Vercel:
+   - `VITE_SUPABASE_URL`
+   - `VITE_SUPABASE_ANON_KEY`
+3. Deploy.
+
+## 6. Verification
+
+After deployment:
+- test input di `mutabaah`, `UKL`, dan `absensi guru`.
+- pastikan data muncul di Supabase tabel `riwayat`, `riwayat_ukl`, `riwayat_absensi_guru`.
+- refresh beberapa perangkat untuk verifikasi sinkronisasi.
+